","pendingPostUpdateReleaseNotes":{"version":"3.16.2","title":"Release v3.16.2","markdown":"## 新功能\n\n- 本地项目支持一次选择多个文件夹，支持修改名称\n- 远程会话支持常驻进程，本地断连不再影响远程会话\n- 输入框可直接切换模型、调节思考力度并选择团队套餐\n- 历史会话支持按项目归档管理，归档分组默认折叠\n- 设置页新增管理远程设备功能\n- Windows 任务栏与托盘显示未读任务提醒\n- 对话分享改为弹层操作，支持工作流内容与图片预览\n- 新增插件市场，可浏览、安装和管理插件\n- 图片预览支持复制、下载并引用到对话\n- 手机远控支持账号登录，使连接更安全\n- 手机远控新增管理设备功能\n- 文件浏览移至侧边面板，可多标签页打开\n- MiMo 模型支持 API 与 Token 套餐两种接入方式\n- 新增工具搜索，助手可按需查找和加载工具\n\n## 问题修复\n\n- 修复网络中断被误报为远端环境不满足要求的问题\n- 修复模型创建失败时输入丢失、对话卡住的问题\n- 修复达到上下文上限后对话无响应的问题\n- 修复恢复历史会话时附件错乱或被误判失败的问题\n- 修复编辑中的输入在模型切换时被覆盖的问题\n- 修复加速模型不可用时无法回退或输入丢失的问题\n- 修复切换项目或新建任务时草稿丢失的问题\n- 修复后台完成任务未读数与角标计数不正确的问题\n- 修复重启后已关闭的工作区标签再次出现的问题\n- 修复 Windows 下可能越界读取本地文件的安全问题\n- 修复连接日志可能泄露敏感信息的问题\n- 修复模型菜单与思考滑杆的多处显示和交互问题\n- 修复工作流参数过多时运行按钮被挤出屏幕的问题\n- 修复数据库升级后偶发锁定卡顿的问题\n- 修复项目目录缺失时列表报错、无法新建任务的问题\n- 修复添加的附加目录未包含进对话上下文的问题\n- 修复 MCP 应用未就绪时调用失败的问题\n- 修复终端启动时开头输出丢失的问题","releaseDate":"2026-10-19T12:51:44.718Z","releaseNotesByLocale":{"zh-CN":{"title":"Release v3.16.2","markdown":"## 新功能\n\n- 本地项目支持一次选择多个文件夹，支持修改名称\n- 远程会话支持常驻进程，本地断连不再影响远程会话\n- 输入框可直接切换模型、调节思考力度并选择团队套餐\n- 历史会话支持按项目归档管理，归档分组默认折叠\n- 设置页新增管理远程设备功能\n- Windows 任务栏与托盘显示未读任务提醒\n- 对话分享改为弹层操作，支持工作流内容与图片预览\n- 新增插件市场，可浏览、安装和管理插件\n- 图片预览支持复制、下载并引用到对话\n- 手机远控支持账号登录，使连接更安全\n- 手机远控新增管理设备功能\n- 文件浏览移至侧边面板，可多标签页打开\n- MiMo 模型支持 API 与 Token 套餐两种接入方式\n- 新增工具搜索，助手可按需查找和加载工具\n\n## 问题修复\n\n- 修复网络中断被误报为远端环境不满足要求的问题\n- 修复模型创建失败时输入丢失、对话卡住的问题\n- 修复达到上下文上限后对话无响应的问题\n- 修复恢复历史会话时附件错乱或被误判失败的问题\n- 修复编辑中的输入在模型切换时被覆盖的问题\n- 修复加速模型不可用时无法回退或输入丢失的问题\n- 修复切换项目或新建任务时草稿丢失的问题\n- 修复后台完成任务未读数与角标计数不正确的问题\n- 修复重启后已关闭的工作区标签再次出现的问题\n- 修复 Windows 下可能越界读取本地文件的安全问题\n- 修复连接日志可能泄露敏感信息的问题\n- 修复模型菜单与思考滑杆的多处显示和交互问题\n- 修复工作流参数过多时运行按钮被挤出屏幕的问题\n- 修复数据库升级后偶发锁定卡顿的问题\n- 修复项目目录缺失时列表报错、无法新建任务的问题\n- 修复添加的附加目录未包含进对话上下文的问题\n- 修复 MCP 应用未就绪时调用失败的问题\n- 修复终端启动时开头输出丢失的问题"},"en-US":{"title":"Release v3.16.2","markdown":"## New Features\n\n- Local projects now support selecting multiple folders at once, with renaming support\n- Remote sessions now support persistent processes, so local disconnections no longer affect them\n- The input box now lets you switch models, adjust thinking effort, and select team plans directly\n- History sessions can now be archived and managed by project, with archived groups collapsed by default\n- Added remote device management to the Settings page\n- Windows taskbar and tray now show unread task notifications\n- Conversation sharing is now done via a popover, with support for workflow content and image previews\n- Added a plugin marketplace for browsing, installing, and managing plugins\n- Image preview now supports copying, downloading, and referencing images in conversations\n- Mobile remote control now supports account login for more secure connections\n- Added device management to mobile remote control\n- File browsing moved to the side panel and now supports multiple tabs\n- MiMo models now support two access methods: API and Token plans\n- Added tool search, allowing the assistant to find and load tools on demand\n\n## Bug Fixes\n\n- Fixed an issue where network interruptions were misreported as the remote environment not meeting requirements\n- Fixed an issue where input was lost and conversations got stuck when model creation failed\n- Fixed an issue where conversations became unresponsive after reaching the context limit\n- Fixed an issue where attachments were misplaced or incorrectly marked as failed when restoring a history session\n- Fixed an issue where input being edited was overwritten when switching models\n- Fixed an issue where fallback was unavailable or input was lost when the accelerated model was unavailable\n- Fixed an issue where drafts were lost when switching projects or creating new tasks\n- Fixed incorrect unread counts and badge counts for tasks completed in the background\n- Fixed an issue where closed workspace tabs reappeared after restart\n- Fixed a security issue that could allow out-of-bounds reads of local files on Windows\n- Fixed an issue where connection logs could leak sensitive information\n- Fixed multiple display and interaction issues in the model menu and thinking slider\n- Fixed an issue where the Run button was pushed off screen when a workflow had too many parameters\n- Fixed occasional locking and lag after database upgrades\n- Fixed an issue where the list showed errors and new tasks could not be created when the project directory was missing\n- Fixed an issue where additional directories were not included in the conversation context after being added\n- Fixed an issue where calls failed when an MCP app was not ready\n- Fixed an issue where initial output was lost when the terminal started"}}},"receivePreviewUpdates":false,"autoDownloadAndInstallUpdates":false,"skippedElectronUpdateVersions":{},"settingsSyncFirstRunPromptHandled":true,"webRemoteControlExternalRelayDevice":{"deviceSid":"d_DJMbmNQPevG8FbeUMUggB8"},"webRemoteControlLastEnabledContext":{"workspacePath":"E:\\StalkerRevert\\StalkerRevert\\.zcode\\workspace\\default","initialTaskId":"sess_519a1d0e-6c90-4bda-952a-8da8a4ed88e2"}}
